===Czechoslovakia vs Hungary===
In the first half a through-ball from [[Josef Masopust|Masopust]] cut out the Hungarian defense for [[Adolf Scherer|Scherer]] to score. After that [[Viliam Schrojf|Schrojf]] made several saves to deny a Hungarian goal. [[Lajos Tichy|Tichy]] once hit the bar but couldn't score.<ref name="lingua" /><ref>[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NqULbl0RtpY Czechoslovakia vs Hungary on YouTube]</ref>

