===Brazil vs England===
[[Garrincha]] opened the score at the half hour when he headed in a corner by [[Mário Zagallo]]. England equalized when [[Jimmy Greaves]] hit the bar with a looping header and [[Gerry Hitchens]] banged in an instant shot. Soon after halftime Brazil regained advantage after [[Vavá]] headed in a free kick from [[Garrincha]] and six minutes later the Brazilian right winger made it 3–1 with a curling shot into the top corner.<ref name="lingua" />

