===Yugoslavia vs West Germany===
The first clear opportunity was for the Germans when [[Uwe Seeler|Seeler]] hit the post with a low shot after running onto [[Helmut Haller|Haller's]] pass. Yugoslavia were also close to score but [[Karl-Heinz Schnellinger|Schnellinger]] cleared the ball off the line following a corner. The only goal of the game came near the end when [[Milan Galić|Galić]] pulled the ball back after working his way to the goal line and [[Petar Radaković|Radaković]] lashed it high into the net.<ref name="lingua" /><ref>[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kOSrXXT-Y-A Yugoslavia vs West Germany on YouTube]</ref>

